__pycache__/
*.pyc
# Inputs are excluded by default (licensing / contamination), with an explicit
# exception for the synthetic prompt set: it is generated deterministically by
# harness/make_prompts.py, carries no licensing question, and committing it is
# what lets a reader rerun the EXACT inputs the numbers came from.
data/*
!data/prompts_512in.txt
# tasks.jsonl is committed: it is general-knowledge items authored for this
# study, not private material. The held-out corpus is NOT committed -- it is
# built from unpublished prose and publishing it would destroy the property
# that makes it a valid perplexity anchor.
!data/tasks.jsonl

# Full per-item task text for debugging. results/raw/ is committed; this is not,
# so task sets can be built from private material without publishing them.
results/audit/

# APEX raw databases: large, and regenerable by re-running the harness.
# The derived per-dimension results land in results/raw/ and ARE committed.
results/apex/
models/
.venv/
*.log
